\ test_comments.stk - `\` comments on their own line and after code
\ Each test prints -1 for pass (Forth true), 0 for fail

3 4 + 7 = .         \ trailing comment with undefined words: foo bar
: sq dup * ;        \ comment after a definition
4 sq 16 = .
5 5 = . \
\ own-line comment: baz qux

\ Print marker for test completion
999 .
